# Copy to .secure.device.env (gitignored) and fill in. mise loads it for `run:android` only.

# The serial of the physical Android device, from `adb devices` (USB debugging on, or `adb pair`/`adb connect` for
# wireless). ANDROID_SERIAL is read by both adb and Gradle's installDebug, so one value picks the device for the
# install and the launch. Not a secret, but specific to your machine.
ANDROID_SERIAL=
